{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Nordhold Supporter Pack: Shine Bright on the Battlefield &amp; the Leaderboard</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a bundle for those who want to support StunForge, the developers of Nordhold.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Golden Tower Skins</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make your defenses stand out with radiant golden tower skins for all 8 towers in Nordhold.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453990/extras/GoldTower2.png?t=1742922027\" /> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Original Soundtrack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in the world of Nordhold with the official soundtrack.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453990/extras/Music.png?t=1742922027\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Your Leaderboard Entry</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a special thank you, all supporters will receive a Golden Frame and a special icon on the leaderboard of Nordhold.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453990/extras/Golden.png?t=1742922027\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>High-Resolution Wallpaper</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Additionally, you will get some high-resolution wallpaper for your desktop background!<br><br><strong>Where do I find the OST + Wallpaper?</strong>All Supporter Pack items can be found in <strong>Steam\\steamapps\\common\\Nordhold</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3453990?t=1742922027","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453990/31eb17688d786b3e63f23e898d65cb71661cb0ef/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742922027","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453990/21c8c4d044439641a8edd453cd31aa7cb2033183/capsule